Z||000012||DaRkLoRD||08-07-2000||12:36 AM||||In no particular order....<P>Mazda MX-3 Precidia<BR>Mitsubishi 3000GT<BR>Eagle Talon<BR>1990+ Porsche 944<BR>2nd gen Mazda RX-7 (turbo version..)<BR>Acura NSX<BR>1995 Pontiac Firebird<BR>C5 Vette (I never liked the stingrays at all.. or anything before the mid 80s..)<BR>Acura Integra VTEC (real one.. not ricer imitation..)<BR>Ford Probe GT & LX (my dad used to have an 89 Probe LX.. I loved that little car.. especially the digital dash!)<BR>Lotus Esprit<BR>Jaguar XJ220<BR>Ferrari F355 (coupe & spyder)<BR>Lamborghini Diablo (well.. some of them.. I forget which model is which!)<BR>Oldsmobile Alero<BR>1999 Pontiac Grand Prix<BR>Honda Del Sol (I know.. it's a ricey copy of the Fiero... but I really like the way they look!)<BR>Toyota MR2 (same reason as above..)<BR>94+ Ford Mustang<BR>Nissan 300ZX (almost forgot about them!)<BR>Jeep Grand Cherokees (look awesome, comfortable, and they're good in winter!)<P>oh yeah, and there's also that little 2 seater sports car pontiac made in the 80s... those look really nice.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 08-07-2000).]||||reg||14
