Z||000014||My7Fieros||08-07-2000||02:18 AM||||Ok, I though of some more...<BR>98-2000 Trans Am<BR>1981 Trans Am (the turbo model w/ the off set scoop)<BR>Lamborghini Countach (duh!)<BR>94-98 Mustang (Even though I constantly bash them because I see them everywhere, they are beautiful cars...but, you can keep that new edge crap design of the 99-2000)<BR>And here we go, I'll prob. have to put on my flame suit for this one, but my favorite all time car, &lt;sigh&gt; yes, the ONLY (and I mean the ONLY) car I like better than the Fiero...1981-83 DeLorean..I WILL have on one day!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-07-2000).]||||reg||1
